  unitName: Cait Sith
  unitId: 50172
  unitNumber: 278
  description: A feline monster with 3 horns. This Al-mi'raj mutation may look like
    a cat, but its personality is extremely ferocious. Even when tamed, it's difficult
    to get it to follow orders. Using both its claws and horns to tear up any prey
    careless enough to get close, Cait Sith's have also been called the "Slice and
    Dice Fur Ball" in the wild. There are some enthusiasts who prize their pet Cait
    Siths as hunting cats which they use to capture Imps and Incubus's.
